#. Description of the plugin
#: presshangar-draft-pacer.php
msgid ""
"Source-agnostic natural pacing publishing layer for WordPress drafts, by "
"PressHangar (a brand of Musubiemu LLC). Schedules drafts as \"future\" posts"
" with human-like intervals and guarantees zero missed publications via a "
"self-healing watchdog. Does not generate any content."
msgstr ""
"WordPress の下書きを、人間らしい間隔で自然なペースで公開するソース非依存の公開レイヤー（PressHangar／Musubiemu LLC "
"のブランド）。下書きを「予約」投稿として人間らしい間隔でスケジュールし、自己修復するウォッチドッグにより公開漏れをゼロに保ちます。コンテンツの生成は行いません。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: presshangar-draft-pacer.php
msgid "Musubiemu LLC"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: presshangar-draft-pacer.php
msgid "https://presshangar.com"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of posts scheduled.
#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:102
#, php-format
msgid "PressHangar Draft Pacer scheduled %d draft."
msgid_plural "PressHangar Draft Pacer scheduled %d drafts."
msgstr[0] "PressHangar Draft Pacer が %d 件の下書きを予約しました。"

#. translators: %d: number of posts that failed to schedule.
#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:109
#, php-format
msgid "%d failed."
msgid_plural "%d failed."
msgstr[0] "%d 件が失敗しました。"

#. translators: %d: number of posts reverted to draft.
#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:126
#, php-format
msgid "PressHangar Draft Pacer reverted %d scheduled post back to draft."
msgid_plural ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer reverted %d scheduled posts back to draft."
msgstr[0] "PressHangar Draft Pacer が %d 件の予約投稿を下書きに戻しました。"

#. translators: %d: number of existing scheduled posts adopted into
#. PressHangar Draft Pacer management.
#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:139
#, php-format
msgid ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer adopted %d existing scheduled post into management."
msgid_plural ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer adopted %d existing scheduled posts into management."
msgstr[0] "PressHangar Draft Pacer が既存の予約投稿 %d 件を管理下に取り込みました。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:151
msgid ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer: WP-Cron does not appear to be running (no watchdog "
"activity in over 2 hours). Scheduled posts may not publish on time. Consider"
" setting up an external cron trigger under Settings > PressHangar Draft "
"Pacer."
msgstr ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer: WP-Cron "
"が動作していないようです（2時間以上ウォッチドッグの動作がありません）。予約投稿が予定どおり公開されない可能性があります。「設定 > "
"PressHangar Draft Pacer」から外部cronトリガーの設定をご検討ください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:161 includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:187
#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:224
msgid "You do not have permission to perform this action."
msgstr "この操作を行う権限がありません。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:519
msgid "Status"
msgstr "ステータス"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:523
msgid "Automatic scheduling"
msgstr "自動スケジュール"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:526
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "有効"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:528
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "無効"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:533
msgid "Remaining drafts"
msgstr "残りの下書き"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:537
msgid "Scheduled (PressHangar Draft Pacer-managed)"
msgstr "予約済み（PressHangar Draft Pacer管理）"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:541
msgid "Scheduled (site-wide)"
msgstr "予約済み（サイト全体）"

#. translators: %d: number of scheduled posts outside PressHangar Draft
#. Pacer's management.
#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:548
#, php-format
msgid ""
"There is %d scheduled post outside PressHangar Draft Pacer's management. Use"
" the button below to adopt it so it's included in the counts and protected "
"by failure recovery (the watchdog)."
msgid_plural ""
"There are %d scheduled posts outside PressHangar Draft Pacer's management. "
"Use the button below to adopt them so they're included in the counts and "
"protected by failure recovery (the watchdog)."
msgstr[0] ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer の管理外の予約投稿が %d "
"件あります。下のボタンで取り込むと、件数に含まれ、失敗リカバリ（ウォッチドッグ）で保護されます。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:564
msgid "Next publish"
msgstr "次の公開"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:565
msgid "None scheduled"
msgstr "予約なし"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:568
msgid "Cron health"
msgstr "Cronの状態"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:571
msgid "OK"
msgstr "正常"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:573
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:578
msgid "Total recovered posts"
msgstr "リカバリした投稿の累計"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:588
msgid "Run Assignment Now"
msgstr "今すぐ割り当てを実行"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:591
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to revert all PressHangar Draft Pacer scheduled posts "
"back to draft? This cannot be undone."
msgstr "PressHangar Draft Pacer のすべての予約投稿を下書きに戻します。よろしいですか？この操作は取り消せません。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:594
msgid "Unschedule All"
msgstr "すべて予約解除"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:598
msgid ""
"Import existing scheduled posts into PressHangar Draft Pacer management? "
"Post dates and status will not be changed."
msgstr "既存の予約投稿を PressHangar Draft Pacer の管理に取り込みますか？投稿日時とステータスは変更されません。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:601
msgid "Adopt Existing Scheduled Posts"
msgstr "既存の予約投稿を取り込む"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:611
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "設定を保存"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:617
msgid "External Cron Setup Guide"
msgstr "外部Cron設定ガイド"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:619
msgid "DISABLE_WP_CRON is defined on this site."
msgstr "このサイトでは DISABLE_WP_CRON が定義されています。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:619
msgid ""
"WordPress will not trigger cron automatically; an external trigger is "
"required."
msgstr "WordPress は自動的にcronを実行しません。外部トリガーが必要です。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:621
msgid ""
"WP-Cron relies on site visits to run scheduled tasks, which can be "
"unreliable on low-traffic sites. Setting up a real server cron job is "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"WP-Cron "
"はサイトへのアクセスを起点に予約タスクを実行するため、アクセスの少ないサイトでは不安定になりがちです。サーバーの実cronジョブの設定を推奨します。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:623
msgid ""
"Add one of the following lines to your server crontab (runs every 15 "
"minutes):"
msgstr "サーバーのcrontabに次のいずれかの行を追加してください（15分ごとに実行）："

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:630
msgid "Where to paste it"
msgstr "貼り付け場所"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:632
msgid "Shared hosting"
msgstr "共有ホスティング"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:633
msgid ""
"Most hosting control panels (cPanel, Plesk, and most rental servers) have a "
"'Cron jobs' section. Paste the line above there. If the panel asks for "
"command and schedule separately, set the schedule to every 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどのホスティング管理画面（cPanel、Plesk、多くのレンタルサーバー）には「Cron "
"jobs（cronジョブ）」の項目があります。上の行をそこに貼り付けてください。コマンドとスケジュールを別々に入力する場合は、スケジュールを15分ごとに設定します。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:635
msgid "VPS / dedicated server"
msgstr "VPS / 専用サーバー"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:636
msgid "Run `crontab -e` and paste the line above on a new line."
msgstr "`crontab -e` を実行し、上の行を新しい行に貼り付けてください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:638
msgid "Home server"
msgstr "自宅サーバー"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:639
msgid ""
"If WordPress runs on your own machine, use crontab on Linux/macOS, or Task "
"Scheduler on Windows to run the command every 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"WordPress をご自身のマシンで動かしている場合は、Linux/macOS では crontab、Windows "
"ではタスクスケジューラを使って、コマンドを15分ごとに実行してください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:641
msgid ""
"No cron settings available? Some hosts don't offer cron at all. You can "
"register the URL above with a free external ping service such as cron-"
"job.org — or simply skip this step. External cron is only an extra safety "
"net: the plugin works with the normal WordPress cron, and the built-in "
"watchdog rescues any missed posts."
msgstr ""
"cron設定が使えない場合：cronを提供していないホストもあります。その場合は上のURLを cron-job.org "
"などの無料の外部pingサービスに登録するか、このステップを省略しても構いません。外部cronはあくまで追加の安全策です。プラグインは通常のWordPress"
" cronで動作し、内蔵のウォッチドッグが公開漏れを救済します。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-scheduler.php:64
msgid "No draft posts were found to schedule."
msgstr "予約対象の下書き投稿が見つかりませんでした。"

#. translators: 1: number of posts scheduled, 2: date/time of the last
#. scheduled post, 3: number of posts that failed.
#: includes/class-phdrip-scheduler.php:131
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Scheduled %1$d draft(s). Last post is set for %2$s. %3$d failed and were "
"left as drafts."
msgstr "%1$d 件の下書きを予約しました。最後の投稿は %2$s に設定されています。%3$d 件は失敗し、下書きのままです。"

#. translators: 1: number of posts scheduled, 2: date/time of the last
#. scheduled post.
#: includes/class-phdrip-scheduler.php:139
#, php-format
msgid "Scheduled %1$d draft(s). Last post is set for %2$s."
msgstr "%1$d 件の下書きを予約しました。最後の投稿は %2$s に設定されています。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:131
msgid "Drip Publishing Settings"
msgstr "ドリップ公開設定"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:137
msgid "Enable automatic scheduling"
msgstr "自動スケジュールを有効にする"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:138
msgid "Posts per day"
msgstr "1日あたりの投稿数"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:139
msgid "Publishing time window"
msgstr "公開する時間帯"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:140
msgid "Start date"
msgstr "開始日"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:141
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "投稿タイプ"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:142
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "カテゴリー"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:143
msgid "Assignment order"
msgstr "割り当て順序"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:144
msgid "Failure recovery"
msgstr "失敗リカバリ"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:145
msgid "Notification email"
msgstr "通知メール"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:185
msgid ""
"Minimum posts per day cannot exceed the maximum. The maximum was raised to "
"match the minimum."
msgstr "1日あたりの最小投稿数が最大値を超えることはできません。最大値を最小値に合わせて引き上げました。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:207
msgid ""
"The end time must be later than the start time. The previous time window was"
" kept."
msgstr "終了時刻は開始時刻より後である必要があります。以前の時間帯を維持しました。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:257
msgid ""
"The notification email address is not valid. The previous value was kept."
msgstr "通知メールアドレスが正しくありません。以前の値を維持しました。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:312
msgid "Automatically schedule drafts on a daily basis."
msgstr "毎日、下書きを自動的に予約します。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:324
msgid "Min"
msgstr "最小"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:329
msgid "Max"
msgstr "最大"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:332
msgid ""
"A random number of posts within this range will be scheduled each day "
"(1-50)."
msgstr "この範囲内のランダムな数の投稿が毎日予約されます（1〜50）。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:343
msgid "From"
msgstr "開始"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:348
msgid "To"
msgstr "終了"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:351
msgid ""
"Posts will only be scheduled within this daily time window (site time). At "
"least 15 minutes apart."
msgstr "投稿はこの毎日の時間帯内（サイト時刻）にのみ予約されます。間隔は最低15分空きます。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:362
msgid ""
"The earliest date new posts may be assigned to. Existing scheduled posts are"
" never overwritten."
msgstr "新しい投稿が割り当てられる最も早い日付です。既存の予約投稿が上書きされることはありません。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:401
msgid ""
"Applies to the \"Post\" post type only. Leave empty to include all "
"categories."
msgstr "「投稿」タイプにのみ適用されます。すべてのカテゴリーを対象にする場合は空欄のままにしてください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:412
msgid "Random"
msgstr "ランダム"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:413
msgid "Oldest first"
msgstr "古い順"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:426
msgid ""
"Automatically republish posts that missed their scheduled publish time."
msgstr "予約公開時刻を過ぎてしまった投稿を自動的に再公開します。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:428
msgid ""
"Adopted posts (see \"Scheduled (site-wide)\" above) are covered by failure "
"recovery once imported."
msgstr "取り込んだ投稿（上の「予約済み（サイト全体）」を参照）は、取り込み後は失敗リカバリの対象になります。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-settings.php:439
msgid ""
"Email address to notify when posts are recovered. Leave empty to disable "
"notifications."
msgstr "投稿がリカバリされた際に通知するメールアドレスです。通知を無効にする場合は空欄のままにしてください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-watchdog.php:47
msgid "Every 15 Minutes (PressHangar Draft Pacer)"
msgstr "15分ごと（PressHangar Draft Pacer）"

#. translators: 1: site name, 2: number of recovered posts.
#: includes/class-phdrip-watchdog.php:152
#, php-format
msgid "[%1$s] PressHangar Draft Pacer recovered %2$d missed post(s)"
msgstr "[%1$s] PressHangar Draft Pacer が %2$d 件の公開漏れ投稿をリカバリしました"

#. translators: %d: number of recovered posts.
#: includes/class-phdrip-watchdog.php:159
#, php-format
msgid ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer detected %d post(s) that failed to publish on their "
"scheduled time (likely a WP-Cron issue) and republished them immediately. "
"You may want to check that WP-Cron is running reliably on your site."
msgstr ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer は、予約時刻に公開できなかった投稿を %d 件検出し（WP-Cron "
"の問題と思われます）、直ちに再公開しました。WP-Cron がサイトで正しく動作しているかご確認ください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer publishes your backlog of drafts automatically, "
"spaced out at natural, human-like intervals — with a watchdog that makes "
"sure nothing is missed. It never generates content. New here? These few "
"steps get you going."
msgstr ""
"PressHangar Draft Pacer "
"は、たまった下書きを自動で公開します。自然で人間らしい間隔をあけて配信し、取りこぼしを防ぐウォッチドッグ付きです。コンテンツを生成することはありません。初めての方は、次の手順で始められます。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Turn on automatic scheduling"
msgstr "自動スケジュールをオンにする"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"In the settings below, choose which post types and categories to pace and "
"how fast to publish, tick \"Enable automatic scheduling\", then Save."
msgstr "下の設定で、ペース配分する投稿タイプとカテゴリー、公開の速さを選び、「自動スケジュールを有効にする」にチェックを入れて保存してください。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Schedule your current drafts"
msgstr "いまある下書きをスケジュールする"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"Press \"Run Assignment Now\" above to space out the drafts you already have."
" After that, new drafts are paced automatically every day."
msgstr "上の「今すぐ割り当てを実行」を押すと、すでにある下書きが間隔をあけて配置されます。以降は新しい下書きが毎日自動でペース配分されます。"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid "Make sure posts publish on time"
msgstr "投稿が時間どおりに公開されるようにする"

#: includes/class-phdrip-admin.php:0
msgid ""
"Drip publishing relies on WordPress cron. If \"Cron health\" above shows a "
"warning, follow the External Cron Setup Guide on this page — the built-in "
"watchdog still rescues any missed post in the meantime."
msgstr ""
"ドリップ公開は WordPress の cron "
"に依存します。上の「Cronの状態」に警告が出ている場合は、このページの「外部Cron設定ガイド」に従ってください。その間も内蔵のウォッチドッグが取りこぼした投稿を必ず復旧します。"
